  "rationale": "Stage 7: P4 pair-geometry spine. 12 packages (10 classification, 2 boundary) covering the rank-one/rank-two pair obstructions, the secant/tangent lower-pair components, the decomposable rank-two family and rank-drop theorem, the lower-pair exhaustion corollary, the four-document pure-rank-two cluster (canonical theorem, chart closure, toric boundary subclaim in the boundaries/ subpackage, Segre slice reduction), and the two support-degeneration boundary inclusions, move from the root into claims/p4/classifications/pair-geometry/<package>/ and claims/p4/boundaries/pair-geometry/<package>/. Human review reassigned 11 p4/boundaries records to pair-geometry classifications (their documents are structural theorems, not boundary inclusions) and kept the two genuine boundary inclusions under p4/boundaries. Excluded: global pair-rank reduction machinery, shared component verifiers, marked-delta2 and mixed-determinantal classifications (deferred), P5 consumers, legacy artifacts.",
